{"assets":["/statement-assets/a9f21b0fe79dbb431692ec2a6384b6f86800c443127577856ca676cd8a2f11f9.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1609","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. William The Oblivious "}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/a9f21b0fe79dbb431692ec2a6384b6f86800c443127577856ca676cd8a2f11f9.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Before becoming a successful trader William got a university degree. During his education an interesting situation happened, after which William started to listen to homework assignments much more attentively. What follows is a formal description of the homework assignment as William heard it:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ only consisting of characters \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". There are $$$q$$$ queries of format ($$$pos, c$$$), meaning replacing the element of string $$$s$$$ at position $$$pos$$$ with character $$$c$$$. After each query you must output the minimal number of characters in the string, which have to be replaced, so that the string doesn't contain string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"subsequence"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". A valid replacement of a character is replacing it with \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A string $$$x$$$ is said to be a subsequence of string $$$y$$$ if $$$x$$$ can be obtained from $$$y$$$ by deleting some characters without changing the ordering of the remaining characters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ $$$(1 \\le n, q \\le 10^5)$$$, the length of the string and the number of queries, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains the string $$$s$$$, consisting of characters \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$q$$$ lines contains an integer $$$i$$$ and character $$$c$$$ $$$(1 \\le i \\le n)$$$, index and the value of the new item in the string, respectively. It is guaranteed that character's $$$c$$$ value is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query output the minimal number of characters that would have to be replaced so that the string doesn't contain \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as a subsequence."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9 12\naaabccccc\n4 a\n4 b\n2 b\n5 a\n1 b\n6 b\n5 c\n2 a\n1 a\n5 a\n6 b\n7 b\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n1\n2\n2\n1\n2\n1\n2\n2\n2\n2\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's consider the state of the string after each query: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$s = $$$\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaaaccccc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". In this case the string does not contain \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as a subsequence and no replacements are needed."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$s = $$$\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaabccccc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". In this case